    "steam_appid": 2688140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688140/extras/b32065ab38ec1b0939cf44b28af11d4d.avif?t=1707635371\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>Enter a world where survival becomes a lethal game. where your simple trip to the supermarket turns into a terrifying nightmare when a thick, unfathomable fog engulfs the city, isolating the supermarket as the only safe haven. What seems like a safe haven, however, turns out to be<br>serves as a deadly prison for those who venture beyond its limits.<br><br>In &quot;Amidst the Haze,&quot; the normality of an ordinary trip to the grocery store is quickly transformed into a survival nightmare. A dense, ominous fog engulfs the city, confining a group of customers and employees to the supermarket,<br>the only apparently safe place. However, what lurks outside this sanctuary could be an unknown, lethal threat.<br><br>This oppressive fog is not merely atmospheric, but rather a veil that conceals terrifying, nameless entities. Those who venture out of the supermarket face an uncertain fate,<br>risking their lives before these dark creatures. The fight for survival becomes a battle between staying within the familiar but increasingly claustrophobic walls or risking the unknown outside.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688140/extras/76e03b80ced08593cc3cba4983c26e7b.avif?t=1707635371\" width=600 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >]ATMOSPHERE</h2><br>Survive inside a supermarket filled with intense and claustrophobic fog, where supernatural beings live.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >]OBJECTIVES]</h2><br>You will need to join the others in the supermarket and find a way to survive the unknown. Seek an answer to everything that is happening,<br>solve missions and fight for your life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DURATION</h2><br> Considerably short game, there are no save points.",
